WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.137
India and the Nijjar assassination.

00:00:03.087 --> 00:00:12.650
On June 18, 2023, Hardeep Singh Nijjar, a Canadian citizen, was shot and killed at a gurdwara in Surrey, British Columbia.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:18.487
Canada presented credible allegations linking agents of the Indian government to the killing.

00:00:18.487 --> 00:00:22.487
Three Indian nationals were charged with first-degree murder.

00:00:22.487 --> 00:00:30.000
This case demonstrated that foreign interference extends beyond elections to extrajudicial violence on Canadian soil.
